Subject: mt7996: expand the bounded PS transition trace budget

Raise only the optional P-event limit from 128 to 1024 records per five
seconds so a short two-link MLO observation can identify remaining gaps.
Keep tracing off by default, the F-event limit at eight, and all eligibility,
sequence and log-format behavior unchanged. This is diagnostic capacity,
not a PS scheduling fix or proof of firmware/RF wake or the original stall.

Index: mt76-2026.10.08~639e1287/mt7996/mcu.c
===================================================================
--- mt76-2026.10.08~639e1287.orig/mt7996/mcu.c
+++ mt76-2026.10.08~639e1287/mt7996/mcu.c
@@ -1151,7 +1151,7 @@ MODULE_PARM_DESC(ps_trace, "Trace MLO PS
